8️⃣ Time & Space Complexity
Type	Complexity
Time	O(E log V)
Space	O(V + E)
9️⃣ Important Interview Notes ⚡

✅ Works only with non-negative weights
❌ Fails for negative weights (use Bellman-Ford)
✅ Uses Greedy approach
✅ Very frequently asked in FAANG

🔟 One-Line Explanation (For Viva)

Dijkstra’s Algorithm finds the shortest path from a source to all vertices in a weighted graph using a greedy strategy and a priority queue.
